        <mxCell id="d6c4MA2DxYK4vHpi5IO--1" value="&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;Para que el SP sp_cierres_masivos_afectacion llame al SP sp_aplica_cierre_masivo , el registro del CSV debe cumplir todas estas condiciones:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;1. El campo folio_csuac no debe ser NULL ni vacío&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;2. El campo dictamen no debe ser NULL ni vacío&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;3. El campo bitacora no debe ser NULL ni vacío&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;4. El campo procedente debe ser válido (convertible a 0 o 1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;5. El campo codigo_resolucion debe existir en la tabla acl_tipo_codigo_resolucion con el tipo de procedente correspondiente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="134" y="-1060" width="560" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d6c4MA2DxYK4vHpi5IO--4" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;Si alguna de las condiciones no se cumple, el SP utilizará CONTINUE FOREACH para saltar al siguiente registro sin procesar el actual. Esto significa que:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;1. No se aplicará el cierre para ese folio&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;2. No se insertará ningún registro en la bitácora&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;3. No se realizará ningún cambio en la base de datos para ese registro&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;4. El proceso continuará con el siguiente registro del CSV&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot; face=&quot;Calibri&quot;&gt;Las razones específicas por las que no se llamaría al SP son:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="850" y="-1140" width="560" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
